# Build artefacts of a release. They are uploaded to the GitHub release and
# have no business in the repository: the source is what belongs here, and two
# binaries are thirty megabytes of history that nobody can diff.
happy-downloader_linux-amd64
happy-downloader_linux-arm64
SHA256SUMS

# Generated at build time: the Windows icon, version resource and manifest.
rsrc_*.syso

# The bundled WebView2 runtime: Microsoft's files, over 250 MB, not ours to
# commit. See packaging/windows/webview2/README.md.
packaging/windows/webview2/*
!packaging/windows/webview2/README.md
